<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage back under 9.0 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage back under 9.0 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank said the South African money market shortage fell back to 8.974 billion rand on Tuesday from 9.383 billion rand on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
